MBoxEntry_Subject                     = Subject
MBoxEntry_From                        = From
MBoxEntry_Date                        = Date
MBoxEntry_To                          = To
MBoxEntry_MessageId                   = Message ID
MBoxEntry_Labels                      = Labels
MBoxEntry_ThreadId                    = Thread ID
MBoxEntry_Size                        = Size

MBoxEntry_NoSubject                   = (no subject)

MBoxProvider_Status_Empty             = The mailbox holds no messages.
MBoxProvider_Status_Partial           = Only some of the messages are listed, because a limit was reached.
MBoxProvider_Status_Loading           = The mailbox is being read.
MBoxProvider_Status_Cancelled         = The read of the mailbox was cancelled.
MBoxProvider_Status_Failed            = The mailbox could not be read.

MBoxProvider_Error_Invalid            = The file is not a valid mailbox.

MBoxPreview_Status_Loading            = The message is being read.
MBoxPreview_Status_NotRead            = The message has no body.
MBoxPreview_Status_Truncated          = The message is longer than the preview limit, so it is cut short.
MBoxPreview_Status_Unavailable        = The message cannot be shown.
MBoxPreview_Status_Malformed          = The message is malformed.
MBoxPreview_Status_HtmlOnly           = The message holds no plain text. Use MBox_Open or MBox_Export to read it.
MBoxPreview_Status_NoSelection        = No message is selected.

Command_Description_MBox_Open         = Open the selected messages of the mailbox
Command_Description_MBox_View         = Show a preview of the current message
Command_Description_MBox_Export       = Extract the selected messages of the mailbox
Command_Description_MBox_PreviewFocus = Move the focus between the message list and its preview
